<title>DEMOCRATIC REPUBLIC OF CONGO: Congo Brazzaville peace talks postponed.</title>
<headline>Congo Brazzaville peace talks postponed.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A national mediation committee in the Congo Republic capital Brazzaville said it was postponing Wednesday's hoped-for political peace talks between President Pascal Lissouba and his predecessor Denis Sassou Nguesso.</p>
